":"document_16-o029172-debe-ser-una-pieza-mecanizada-centrada-y-com","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["6. Ruedas y neumáticos"],"styleId":"","text":"Además de conservar suficiente enganche de rosca o utilizar","textHash":"a0bbd1322ffcf509b0255b61849559ea746e58d0b0f71232e232d9a672b21d57"},{"blockId":"block_029174_64a66cd5db","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":29174,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o029172-debe-ser-una-pieza-mecanizada-centrada-y-com","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["6. Ruedas y neumáticos"],"styleId":"","text":"Espárragos extendidos homologados.","textHash":"64a66cd5db28641e7598f641b6590194d2dd53f152d666c388dbfc6e0a55ebc3"},{"blockId":"block_029175_addaf139b9","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":29175,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o029172-debe-ser-una-pieza-mecanizada-centrada-y-com","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["6. Ruedas y neumáticos"],"styleId":"","text":"Caso 6 — Aros centradores","textHash":"addaf139b975b71318736ff543b43a0102d500f34707a2eac56443583800fb58"},{"blockId":"block_029176_e401df3494","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":29176,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o029172-debe-ser-una-pieza-mecanizada-centrada-y-com","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["6. Ruedas y neumáticos"],"styleId":"","text":"Entrada:","textHash":"e401df34940d77269744c377bf21e5c7617c21a324705858e673d2b6def1e1b8"},{"blockId":"block_029177_5b70f0558d","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":29177,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o029172-debe-ser-una-pieza-mecanizada-centrada-y-com","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["6. Ruedas y neumáticos"],"styleId":"ListParagraph","text":"El rin entra, pero queda flojo en el centro.","textHash":"5b70f0558d734f6dd2123102e6d4d6fec2f9677a1a4bad1f32c03699d27c96bd"},{"blockId":"block_029178_3d11968067","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":29178,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o029172-debe-ser-una-pieza-mecanizada-centrada-y-com","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["6. Ruedas y neumáticos"],"styleId":"","text":"Respuesta esperada:","textHash":"3d11968067cf434a07aa60101fa7139e49a6535d208624a5e77317c74c05a00f"},{"blockId":"block_029179_f3fe3fba75","entityId":"document_16-o029179-debes-medir-el-centro-del-rin-y-el-cubo-si-e","kind":"paragraph","order":29179,"parentEntityId":null,"recordRole":"COMPONENT","sectionPath":["6. Ruedas y neumáticos"],"styleId":"","text":"Debes medir el centro del rin y el cubo. Si el rin aftermarket tiene,","textHash":"f3fe3fba75ee0857e9f010ff3c4362a9e0ab1bed18e32335d172016414a1bafc"},{"blockId":"block_029180_29aeee7008","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":29180,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o029179-debes-medir-el-centro-del-rin-y-el-cubo-si-e","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["6. Ruedas y neumáticos"],"styleId":"","text":"Por ejemplo, 73.1 mm y el cubo 54.1 mm, necesita un aro 73.1→54.1.","textHash":"29aeee7008dcc54a5382e2d4f6751b4f3f3c663b6d8253dd46e5a28f15a9fff8"},{"blockId":"block_029181_448c0056a1","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":29181,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o029179-debes-medir-el-centro-del-rin-y-el-cubo-si-e","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["6. Ruedas y neumáticos"],"styleId":"","text":"El aro no corrige un patrón de pernos incorrecto.","textHash":"448c0056a10585be45df858a0b245ecee0b31d25c9d257c7d433e717d70fd65a"},{"blockId":"block_029182_24da148665","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":29182,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o029179-debes-medir-el-centro-del-rin-y-el-cubo-si-e","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["6. Ruedas y neumáticos"],"styleId":"","text":"Caso 7 — Repuesto","textHash":"24da14866547abaa78dbd6c8c0fac864091d49ce7a94c1b1da35581466fc3db6"},{"blockId":"block_029183_e401df3494","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":29183,"parentEntityId":"document_16-o029179-debes-medir-el-centro-del-rin-y-el-cubo-si-e","recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":["6. Ruedas y neumáticos"],"styleId":"","text":"Entrada:","textHash":